      "description": "A responsive Dialog: a centered Dialog at desktop that becomes a swipeable Drawer below 768px. Drop-in replacement for the shadcn Dialog on Base UI or Radix: desktop props 1:1 on the root and every part, open state kept across the breakpoint, footer close button on both sides, plus a drawer={{...}} override typed on your Drawer.",
      "dependencies": [],
      "registryDependencies": ["dialog", "drawer", "button", "use-mobile"],
